#: ../../tools/ebi_taxonomy_tools.rst:32 def57bd6fea742718d9541d131b6c573
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get taxonomy classification by NCBI Taxonomy ID from the"
" EBI Taxonomy service. Returns scientific name, common name, rank, "
"division, full lineage string, genetic codes, authority citation, and "
"alternative names. Example: tax\\_id 9606 returns Homo sapiens with "
"lineage from Eukaryota to Homo."
msgstr ""

